<https://bioschemas.org/profiles/Course/1.0-RELEASE#hasCourseInstance> a sh:PropertyShape ;
    sh:description "A course may be ran multiple times in different locations or at different times. Use hasCourseInstance to list the offerings of this Course. Please see the [Course Instance specification](https://bioschemas.org/specifications/CourseInstance) for the full list of properties. An offering of the course at a specific time and place or through specific media or mode of study or to a specific section of students." ;
