    sh:description "An eventStatus of an event represents its status; particularly useful when an event is cancelled or rescheduled. An eventStatus of an event represents its status; particularly useful when an event is cancelled or rescheduled. Used as text label (e.g. 'postponed', 'cancelled', 'date TBC', 'application open' or 'registration closed')." ;
